  "description": {
   "value": "<p>You have focused on the basics, allowing you to directly manipulate cursed energy to great effect.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Cursed Strike</strong>. On a hit, you can spend up to your proficiency bonus, dealing an additional d8 necrotic damage per CE spent.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Cursed Reinforcement</strong>. As an action you can spend up to your Cursed Energy modifier to reinforce your body. You gain 5 temporary hit points per CE.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
